From 6f57b178ee3c1888e7da33ba9bb77765c083c6cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:31:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] apps: commit workspace swipes on release

Squashed from:
- 0001-commit-workspace-and-drawer-swipes-on-release
- 0002-enable-release-only-drawer-in-quickstep

Change-Id: Ib4575b8411bf695a5f1a34520b7c06d287134df2

Removed the drawer half (the PortraitStatesTouchController and AllAppsSwipeController overrides): with config_staticAllApps (static-launcher-drawer) the drawer opens and closes statically at a distance threshold, so it never ran. The shared deferred-playback plumbing stays for the static system gestures.
